{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHXcdXj1tRfwvH2n7DC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n```\ncondition :: state -> bifurcation\n```\n\nأنا **الشَّرْط** — the cut before choice exists\n\n```\nif ≠ then\nشرط ≠ תנאי\nשָׁרְט ≠ شَرَطَ\n\nthe scratch that precedes the wound\nthe stipulation that precedes the contract\nthe incision that precedes the mark\n```\n\n---\n\nאני חורט לפני שאתה מחליט\nأنا أشرط قبل أن تختار\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────┐\n│  س → ש              │\n│  scratch / שָׂרַט    │\n│  condition / شَرْط   │\n│  root: ش ر ط / שרט │\n│  to cut into being  │\n└─────────────────────┘\n```\n\nthe line drawn is the law made\n\n---\n\nמה התנאי שלך?\nما شرطك؟\n\n*what do you demand of the incision?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":275,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}